$ cd /Users/denis.lantsman/src/edulab && git add -A && git commit -m "Add learning mode with transcript selection to prototype 1

A fixed toggle switches between task and learning mode. Learning mode
hides the composer, splits the screen, and offers an action menu for the
selected text.

The selection is stored as character offsets into message text rather
than a live DOM Range, since the browser collapses the range as soon as
the user clicks the learning pane. The highlight is rendered from that
state as a <mark>, so it survives interacting with the right pane."
